:"iiiron","id":23551985,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNTUxOTg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23551985?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iiiron","html_url":"https://github.com/iiiron","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iiiron/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iiiron/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iiiron/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iiiron/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iiiron/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iiiron/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iiiron/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iiiron/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iiiron/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-18T18:03:01Z","updated_at":"2024-12-18T18:03:01Z","body":"I think this should be a problem caused by memory management","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2551958612/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4951969278","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100545#issuecomment-4951969278","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100545","id":4951969278,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJykN_g","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-12T16:46:01Z","updated_at":"2026-07-12T16:46:01Z","body":"This is intended behaviour.\n\n`StepDeal` is `RefCounted`, so when it is not referenced any more it will be freed and all it's co-routines get cancelled.\n\nPer default a co-routine does not keep the `self` object alive. In cases were you want this, you can reference the object from with the co-routine to prevent it from getting cleaned up (`var _self = self`). Just keep in mind, that depending on how you use the class you might leak the object, since if the co-routine never finishes the object would stay alive.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4951969278/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]